### Owner: Leo — Waves 1 and 2
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### E30 — List active alerts and alerts resolved in the last 24 hours
GET {{baseUrl}}/alertas
Accept: application/json

### E31 — List notification channels
GET {{baseUrl}}/canales-notificacion
Accept: application/json

### E32 - Update notification channels
PUT {{baseUrl}}/canales-notificacion
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

[
  { "id": 1, "activo": true },
  { "id": 2, "activo": false }
]

### E32 - Reject disabling all channels (expected: 422)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/canales-notificacion
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

[
  { "id": 1, "activo": false },
  { "id": 2, "activo": false }
]

### E33 - Notify product with an active alert
POST {{baseUrl}}/notificaciones/stock-bajo
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "productoId": 1
}

### E33 - Product without an active alert (expected: 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notificaciones/stock-bajo
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "productoId": 4
}